{"id":"event_foolburstday_03","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev130007","label":"Foolburstday"},"label":"I'll Arrest You!","stage":null,"prev":"event_foolburstday_02","next":"event_foolburstday_04","speakers":{"poli":"Poli","mechashifty":"Mecha Shifty","drake":"Drake","miranda":"Miranda","quiry":"Quiry"},"icons":{"poli":"si_c030_00_s","mechashifty":"si_c993_00_s","drake":"si_c101_00_s","miranda":"si_c032_00_s","quiry":"si_c033_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_1","text":"After the incident at the Toy Store, Elegg and Exia beat a swift retreat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Jail","bgArt":"jail","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_2","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_2","text":"Meanwhile, Mecha Shifty and I aren't so lucky,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_3","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_3","text":"and find ourselves locked in the detention center.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mechashifty","poli"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_4","text":"Let me get this straight.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_tepidappleade","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_5","text":"In the process of trying to teach this robot, who's called Mecha Shifty, about human emotions, the speech circuits were messed up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_6","text":"This caused Mecha Shifty to reboot, which itself resulted in an explosion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_7","text":"I know it sounds made up, but it's true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_8","text":"*Sigh*... Considering all the crazy things that have happened here, it's not all that outlandish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_9","text":"Fortunately the Toy Store didn't sustain any major damage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_10","text":"It could have been a lot worse. The entire Outpost could have been endangered.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_11","text":"Please be more careful next time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_12","text":"I'm sorry. I'll be more cautious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_13","text":"??","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_14","text":"You're always working so hard, Officer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_15","text":"*Gasp*!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_16","text":"That may be the first time anyone's ever called me \"officer!\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_17","text":"It's only natural to show respect to those who work tirelessly to keep the citizens safe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_18","text":"What's gotten into you? Stop pretending and act the way you normally do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_19","text":"In this world, one must always defer to authority.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_20","text":"... You are really getting on my nerves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_21","text":"May I ask a question, oh respected Officer?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_22","text":"Certainly. Go ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_23","text":"Why are these two locked up in the detention center with us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["miranda","drake"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_24","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_25","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_26","text":"I don't even have the energy to explain. Think of it as an April Fool's Day tradition.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_27","text":"I get why Drake is here, but why Miranda?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_28","text":"I told a lie. I said that Poli had gotten taller.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_29","text":"What!? Not even the most dastardly villain would utter such a heinous falsehood!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_30","text":"I'm sorry! I'll never tell such an incredulous, absurd, and baseless lie again!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_31","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_32","text":"Show some proper respect to the Officer, both of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_33","text":"But I'm a police officer too...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_34","text":"Oh! I'm sorry. Please forgive my rudeness. Allow me to get on my knees and give an apology of the utmost sincerity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_35","text":"But you don't have knees.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_36","text":"Ah, now I understand","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_37","text":"why inferior beings walk on two legs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_38","text":"It's so you can genuflect in apology.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_39","text":"The reason superior beings such as myself do not walk on two legs is because the act of kneeling is simply not part of our DNA.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_40","text":"What are you blabbering about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_41","text":"Poli, we've got a problem! The Toy Store was burned to the ground!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["quiry"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_42","text":"There's nothing left!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_43","text":"You're talking to the towel again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_44","text":"Oh... I swear this towel looks more like you with each passing day.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_45","text":"Or your eyes are getting worse.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_46","text":"Anyway, what do you mean the Toy Store burned down? It was fine when I saw it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_47","text":"What? No, it was completely incinerated!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_48","text":"I saw it myself!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_49","text":"Are you sure your eyes weren't playing tricks on you like usual?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_50","text":"No! I saw it up close, and even touched it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_51","text":"Ugh, fine. I'll go and check it out right away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_52","text":"April Fool's!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_53","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_54","text":"Haha, you completely fell for it, Poli!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_55","text":"... You're right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_56","text":"By the way, Quiry, could you come here for a moment?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_57","text":"Sure, what's wrong?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_58","text":"Walk forward a little bit. Yes, yes, straight ahead, just like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_59","text":"Do you see that chair?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_60","text":"Hmm... I only see a dog the size of a chair.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_61","text":"Well, it's a chair, so sit down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_62","text":"Okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_63","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_63","text":"*Slide* *Bang*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_64","text":"Huh? What was that sound?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_65","text":"It's the sound of a jail cell closing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_66","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_67","text":"Did you just lock me in the cell?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_68","text":"Lying is a serious crime.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_69","text":"But... isn't this going a bit far?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_70","text":"I've already had it up to here with all this April Fool's Day nonsense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_71","text":"I don't need my own officers messing with me on top of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_72","text":"Both of you sit here and think about what you've done.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_73","text":"Aw man...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_74","text":"I'm sorry! I won't ever lie again! You're not tall, Poli, you're short! Really, really short!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_75","text":"Grr...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_76","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_77","text":"Fine. Since nothing bad happened to the Toy Store, I'll let you two off with a warning.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_78","text":"You can come out now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_79","text":"Thanks, Poli. It's always a pleasure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_80","text":"Not you! I mean the Commander and Mecha Shifty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_81","text":"What?! But the sale at the Shopping Mall is about to end!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_82","text":"You see that, Mecha Shifty? You do something bad, you get punished.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_83","text":"That's why you need to be an upstanding citizen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_84","text":"I will engrave these words onto my heart, oh merciful Officer... or my engine, rather. In fact, I should probably use a laser engraver...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_85","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_85","text":"Thanks, Poli. We'll get out of your hair.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_86","text":"Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_87","text":"... Be careful today.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_03_88","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_03_88","text":"I will. Thanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}